{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1028105-cavaliers-of-mars-wod-crossover","id":1028105,"title":"Cavaliers of Mars/WoD crossover","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Cavaliers of Mars"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-07T04:15:53-08:00","id":1028105,"title":"Cavaliers of Mars/WoD crossover","content":"Does anyone else think it would be great to use Cavaliers of Mars as a look at the Shade Realm of Mars from Mage: the Ascension?<br /> <br /> <br /> Colleen","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-07T08:14:00-08:00","id":1028160,"title":"","content":"Yes. You can cross over with CoD as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-08T16:16:09-08:00","id":1028734,"title":"","content":"The relationship between <i>Vampire</i> and <i>Cavaliers</i> is primarily my undying belief in the sweetness of the human heart.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T04:24:53-08:00","id":1028961,"title":"","content":"That's beautiful, Rose. Thank you for posting that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-15T07:35:52-08:00","id":1049292,"title":"","content":"As an aside, i have strongly considered porting Cavaliers of Mars, in parts or even whole cloth, into Exalted through either the South of Creation, Endless Desert of Cecelyne or maybe even somewhere the dunes and wastes of both mix and mash into whole different vistas of a place its own. The desertic overworld realm of Aten from Scion might be an interesting alternative/addition too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-15-2017, 10:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T12:09:35-08:00","id":1053936,"title":"","content":"As an aside, aren't the celestial bodies of the solar system explored from an Umbral/Garou point of view in some book?<br /> Not quite sure right now if it was Velvet Shadow or some other module.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T13:47:07-08:00","id":1053986,"title":"","content":"Yes. Rage Across the Heavens details the Aetherial Realm, which runs parallel to both Etherspace and the physical solar system. I meant to say Cavaliers of Mars would go great in the SHARD REALM of Mars, not the SHADE REALM of Forces (M20 clarified the difference between the two).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:10:50-08:00","id":1054000,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JulianMoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1028105-cavaliers-of-mars-wod-crossover?p=1053986#post1053986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes. Rage Across the Heavens details the Aetherial Realm, which runs parallel to both Etherspace and the physical solar system. I meant to say Cavaliers of Mars would go great in the SHARD REALM of Mars, not the SHADE REALM of Forces (M20 clarified the difference between the two).</div> </div> </div> </div>Must admit i'm not very on the difference between the Shard and Shade Realms, or the umbral realms per se (except for a more &quot;savage/primal&quot; aesthetic maybe) - far too much long since i last played Ascension &amp; other stuff i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 02-23-2017, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:22:35-08:00","id":1054007,"title":"","content":"The Shard Realms are in Etherspace and the Deep Umbra, and are the &quot;mythic&quot; versions of the planets, which is perfect for Cavaliers of Mars. The Shade Realms are located on the First Horizon, and represent the nine Spheres of Awakened magick. I just read M20 :-).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-23T14:40:19-08:00","id":1054021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JulianMoon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1028105-cavaliers-of-mars-wod-crossover?p=1054007#post1054007\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Shard Realms are in Etherspace and the Deep Umbra, and are the &quot;mythic&quot; versions of the planets, which is perfect for Cavaliers of Mars. The Shade Realms are located on the First Horizon, and represent the nine Spheres of Awakened magick. I just read M20 :-).</div> </div> </div> </div>So the Shade Realms are the more awakened-centric parts of the cosmos so to speak, while the Shards are part of a mythic-fantastic multitude of spirit/psychic realms that might be part or at least touch into what the Shapeshifters knows as Umbra. Speaking in rough, general terms so to speak.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-24T05:19:46-08:00","id":1054271,"title":"","content":"According to M20, the Shard Realms are mostly visited by mages, but you could have Shapeshifters visit them in your campaign if you wanted. The Shard Realms basically run parallel to the Aetherial Realm, which actually is often visited by Garou and is detailed in Rage Across the Heavens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My name is Colleen. My favorite song is &quot;Wildwood Flower.&quot; My ambition is to write the complete history of the White Wolf/Onyx Path universe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11905-julianmoon","name":"JulianMoon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"253"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}